1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,439
Stop.

10
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:01,560
Auntie, what is it?

11
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,159
You ruined Lu Qian's engagement.

12
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:07,920
That's not gonna fly.

13
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,840
I'll give you a chance
to make up for your mistake.

14
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,879
A gallery likes your art.

15
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,480
Go there.

16
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,239
Consider it your amends.

17
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,920
Auntie...

18
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:19,840
My art is nothing impressive.

19
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,120
I'd rather not go.

20
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,319
Do what I say.

21
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,599
Stop making excuses.

22
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,439
Fine.

23
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,025
=Quite The Girl=

24
00:01:38,026 --> 00:01:38,814
(Adapted from the Tomato Novel
"Quite the Girl.")

25
00:01:38,815 --> 00:01:39,340
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

26
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,660
=Episode 2=

27
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,920
How was it?

28
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,560
Did I play the gallery owner well?

29
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,200
You have no idea what it was like.

30
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,799
Du Wenxin, that miser,

31
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:04,079
the second I mentioned money,

32
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,200
she grinned

33
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,719
from ear to ear.

34
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,400
Good thing Uncle wasn't home.

35
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,680
Dealing with Auntie alone

36
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,680
is much easier.

37
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,039
I really admire you.

38
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:16,319
In a family like that,

39
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:18,439
you still got into
the top one art school.

40
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,479
That's amazing.

41
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,520
Oh, what about your documents

42
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,159
and passport? Have you got them?

43
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,120
Auntie still has them.

44
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,120
Then how can you register?

45
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:31,159
So I need it back ASAP.

46
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,159
And Grandma...

47
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,199
I need to get her out.

48
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:37,120
Clock's ticking, so much to do.

49
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,520
I know

50
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:41,439
grad school there costs a fortune.

51
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,840
It's all I have.

52
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,560
Take it.

53
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,319
I can handle the money.

54
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:50,280
I've been painting in secret.

55
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:52,360
I'll ask the gallery

56
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,520
and see if they can sell my work.

57
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,360
Don't worry.

58
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,680
Did you find that girl?

59
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,240
I went to the studio.

60
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,080
No luck.

61
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,719
Then keep looking.

62
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:02,439
Okay.

63
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,159
What about Auntie Chen?

64
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:06,199
(Seef)
She seemd to be a Cantonese Opera star.

65
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:07,840
She's very elegant.

66
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,680
I bet her kid

67
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,039
probably grew up around art.

68
00:03:10,039 --> 00:03:11,159
Very artistic.

69
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,000
So they suggest we check

70
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:15,199
theaters and galleries.

71
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,719
Then let's split up.

72
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,280
I'll take the gallery.

73
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:22,759
Okay.

74
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:25,100
(Optometrists)

75
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,360
What a great piece.

76
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:30,159
It deserves the best spot.

77
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,080
Sir,

78
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,759
could you keep

79
00:03:33,919 --> 00:03:35,639
my identity confidential?

80
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,080
If that's what you want,

81
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,439
we'll cooperate.

82
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:40,680
Thanks.

83
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,680
Let me get the paperwork.

84
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,439
Okay.

85
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:44,159
This way.

86
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:07,413
♪The day we met the breeze felt sweet♪

87
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:14,700
♪You walked up smiling
like a movie scene♪

88
00:04:16,260 --> 00:04:20,020
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

89
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:23,240
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

90
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:28,906
♪So this is what love feels like♪

91
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:37,826
♪You took my hand, said don't be scared♪

92
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:44,680
♪With you, no place is far♪

93
00:04:45,700 --> 00:04:52,520
♪Now I know what longing is♪

94
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:59,640
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

95
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:11,906
♪Wherever you go♪

96
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:13,906
♪Oh, you♪

97
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,946
♪Wherever you are♪

98
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:20,146
♪Wherever you go♪

99
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:24,986
♪Wherever you go♪

100
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:27,480
♪For you♪

101
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:30,413
♪Wherever you are♪

102
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:33,460
♪Wherever you go♪

103
00:05:34,620 --> 00:05:38,400
♪Wherever you go♪

104
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:40,813
♪For you♪

105
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:44,280
♪Wherever you are♪

106
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:50,000
♪Wherever you go♪

107
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:57,013
♪Wherever you go♪

108
00:06:00,860 --> 00:06:03,400
♪Wherever you go♪

109
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:07,879
Lu Mingyu.

110
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:10,773
(XiA58414)

111
00:06:12,079 --> 00:06:13,040
What are you doing here?

112
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:14,680
Did you sneak out behind my dad's back?

113
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:16,560
Do you know you'll get
my mom in trouble?

114
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:19,480
Why would I care?

115
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,120
Their relationship

116
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,399
has been over for ages.

117
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,959
You know that better.

118
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:24,360
You...

119
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,160
After all,

120
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:29,360
my mom's much prettier than yours.

121
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,639
Your dad's a psycho.

122
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,720
The way he looks at her...

123
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:35,439
Don't think because

124
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:37,079
I defended you before, I won't hit you.

125
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,240
Let me tell you.

126
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,279
My mom knew nothing.

127
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,240
You ruined our family.

128
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:44,319
How can you be so cruel?

129
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,480
You think your words

130
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,680
will make me grateful?

131
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,639
Don't forget how you

132
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:52,439
and Lu Qian bullied me.

133
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,160
The more you defend me,

134
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,399
the more fake you seem.

135
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,720
Enough nonsense.

136
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:02,160
Don't bring up the past.

137
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,319
Go home.

138
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,079
Dad.

139
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,680
Mingyu went out.

140
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:22,800
I saw her at the gallery.

141
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,639
Heaven knows why she'd go there.

142
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:33,199
What were you doing there?

143
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,240
Who sent you?

144
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,000
I...

145
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,319
It was... Auntie.

146
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,399
She told me to go make money.

147
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,480
What nonsense, Lu Mingyu.

148
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,240
I never sent you.

149
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,639
You're the one who can't behave.

150
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,639
If you don't believe me,

151
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,480
go check Auntie's phone.

152
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,199
See if the gallery called.

153
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,639
Hello?

154
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,600
I'm from Yunjian Gallery.

155
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,480
I heard the artist at your birthday

156
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,160
is a member of your family.

157
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,839
We'd like to work with her.

158
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:15,800
Great.

159
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,680
Let's discuss the details.

160
00:08:18,079 --> 00:08:19,800
I didn't want to go.

161
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,279
But when I left yesterday,

162
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:23,160
I ruined Lu Qian's engagement.

163
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,360
I wanted to make it up.

164
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,079
Did I not say

165
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,600
that no one in this house

166
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,040
can let her leave without my say?

167
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,840
Who hurt your neck?

168
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:56,960
♪The free♪

169
00:08:58,759 --> 00:08:59,200
My son.

170
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,120
You wretch.

171
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,480
My son...

172
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:01,840
How dare you.

173
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:04,159
I haven't dealt with you
for letting Mingyu out.

174
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,639
One more word, you're next.

175
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:09,093
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

176
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,320
(Serves you right.)

177
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:19,799
Mingyu...

178
00:09:20,279 --> 00:09:21,320
You never know

179
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:24,200
who might harass you.

180
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,679
Hand over your phone.

181
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:36,679
(Are you sure this is where)

182
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:37,720
(Auntie Chen used to perform?)

183
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,799
(Of course I'm sure.)

184
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,320
(This used to be a theater.)

185
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,960
(Someone bought it)

186
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,039
(and made it a lounge.)

187
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:49,559
(Here's Ms. Chen's hairpin)

188
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,080
(and a painting from her vanity.)

189
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:54,720
(She passed away)

190
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,240
(from illness years ago.)

191
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,360
(My mom would be very sad.)

192
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,159
(The hairpin...)

193
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,919
(Why does it look so familiar?)

194
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,840
So Ye is a girl.

195
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:17,879
Sir.

196
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,919
Can I book this place for a party?

197
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:20,919
Sure.

198
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,919
I'll arrange everything.

199
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:22,879
Rest assured.

200
00:10:43,933 --> 00:10:44,490
(Xu Suyue: Good news!)

201
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,440
(Mingyu,)

202
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,240
(did they take your phone again?)

203
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,120
(The gallery couldn't reach you.)

204
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,320
(They asked me to tell you)

205
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,480
(that your work, "Daybreak,")

206
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,159
(was sold for a high price.)

207
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,440
(The buyer stayed anonymous, too.)

208
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:59,960
(Now I have enough for
tuition and travel.)

209
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,559
(What's most important now)

210
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,279
(is my passport)

211
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,320
(and getting Grandma out of here.)

212
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,720
To whoever bought it,

213
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,080
thank you.

214
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,519
Tomorrow, get Lu Mingyu

215
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,879
some elegant outfits.

216
00:11:15,159 --> 00:11:16,480
There's a party soon.

217
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:18,000
Show her around.

218
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,320
On behalf of the Lu family,

219
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:21,000
find her a wealthy match.

220
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:21,799
ASAP.

221
00:11:22,519 --> 00:11:23,279
Mom!

222
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,320
Are you crazy?

223
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,320
She just ruined my match with the Qins.

224
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,919
Now you want me to help her?

225
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,000
Just do as I say.

226
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,399
Would I ever hurt you?

227
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,679
I don't want to help her either.

228
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,600
I'd rather she marry a beggar.

229
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:40,000
Mom, are you saying...?

230
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,679
After yesterday,

231
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,600
I finally get it.

232
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,919
If she stays unmarried,

233
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:50,720
this family will fall apart.

234
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,240
Also...

235
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:55,480
Your dad can never know.

236
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:06,600
(Xiuming.)

237
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,799
(With this out,)

238
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
(all the young elites in Xizi City)

239
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:10,679
(showed up.)

240
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,120
(Mm.)

241
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:33,093
♪They all believe♪

242
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:39,400
♪Love begins at first sight♪

243
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:47,413
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪

244
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:52,880
♪Through two gazing eyes♪

245
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:59,700
♪But they don't remember♪

246
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,639
It's her.

247
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:05,640
♪Passing by under green lights♪

248
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:11,026
♪In the airport corner♪

249
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:33,813
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

250
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:40,133
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

251
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:48,040
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

252
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:54,200
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

253
00:13:56,840 --> 00:14:03,040
♪A love letter written in song♪

254
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:08,293
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

255
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:16,906
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

256
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:23,253
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

257
00:14:24,140 --> 00:14:30,880
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

258
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,960
♪Close your eyes and count♪

259
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:39,040
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

260
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:43,040
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
